/-!
# S9-C: full linked-active local-density polynomial

The one source/action-generated linked P286 primitive path is evaluated in
the complete chart-zero unified local density.  Its actual curvature and
charged covariant jets are quadratic, so the full density is exactly a
quartic polynomial.

The coefficient bookkeeping keeps the action grammar visible:

* gauge--BF and scalar kinetic coefficients acquire the frozen volume once;
* the scalar potential coefficients acquire the action's minus sign;
* the matter coefficients already contain the frozen volume;
* gravity, simplicity, coframe, and volume are fixed by this internal path.

No derivative, Ward identity, stationarity law, residual zero, target
coefficient, integrability receipt, or supplied path certificate is accepted
as a premise.
-/

open SaturationMonoid

namespace
  SaturationMonoid.PhysicsCore.StageNineP286LinkedActiveFullLocalDensityPolynomial

open ProofFreeRicherAnholonomicSource
open StageNineDynamicBreakingVacuum
open StageNineEnrichedProofFreeSource
